{"id":"vod_hh_27605","vodId":"27605","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"未来日记","name_cn":"未来日记","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/e1ffc9eb1d4c1712a43cfa12a517ae5c.jpg"},"summary":"天野雪辉（富樫美铃 配音）是一个平日里喜欢在手机中记录日常琐事的孤僻少年，一日偶然间，他发现自己居然拥有了能够预知未来的“未来日记”，而此时，兴奋又好奇的他并不知道，自己已经被卷入了一场永无止尽的杀戮游戏中去。作为控制整个游戏的时空之神，宙斯（若本规夫 配音）选中了12名年龄和职业各异的男女，赋予他们拥有不同能力的“未来日记”，而他们所要做的，就是尽其所能利用自己的日记逃避同伴的追杀并且尽可能的杀死同伴。失败的人将和日记一同消失，而最后的胜利者，可以成为下一届游戏的神。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 16:58:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4KWpVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZXZlwb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXVYj5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mbkM6AJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xboJA3Ya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZXZ2Qb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8YXjjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMB7kGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepV94Vb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6VY3Ob/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer7gj2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGKw1Jd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJG27e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKEAgxd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddwgnord/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe03AW5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAO8Rld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://pla